---
Create unit tests for undo/redo system.

Verify state snapshots, undo stack, and redo after undo work correctly.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Test undo reverses last action (step toggle, BPM change, etc.)
- [ ] Test redo re-applies undone action
- [ ] Test undo stack depth limit (no unbounded memory growth)
- [ ] Test redo stack cleared on new action after undo
- [ ] Test undo at empty stack is a no-op
- [ ] Test redo at empty stack is a no-op

## Test Plan
- [ ] Toggle step, undo, verify step reverted
- [ ] Change BPM, undo, verify BPM reverted
- [ ] Undo+redo cycle, verify state matches original
- [ ] Fill undo stack to limit, verify oldest entries discarded
